# Main Things You Use in SQLAlchemy

### 1️⃣ Database connection

```python
app.config["SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URI"] = "sqlite:///user.sqlite3"
```

---

### 2️⃣ Creating models (tables)

```python
class User(db.Model):
```

---

### 3️⃣ Insert data

```python
db.session.add(new_user)
db.session.commit()
```

---

### 4️⃣ Query data

```python
User.query.all()
```

or

```python
User.query.filter_by(email=email).first()
```

